.TH std::text_encoding::aliases 3 "2026.11.10" "http://cppreference.com" "C++ Standard Libary"
.SH NAME
std::text_encoding::aliases \- std::text_encoding::aliases

.SH Synopsis
constexpr aliases_view aliases() const noexcept;  (since C++26)

Returns a non-empty range of type text_encoding::aliases_view containing the aliases of
*this if it represents a known registered character encoding. Otherwise, returns an empty
range of type text_encoding::aliases_view.

.SH Parameters

\fI(none)\fP

.SH Return value

A view containing aliases of the known registered character encoding represented by *this;
otherwise an empty range.

